trainer":"content","instruction":"Listen.","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","atoms":[{"lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-02-on-holiday/lsg/03/03-content-anarhys.lsg","width":300}},{"text":"","sound":"Hey Ana, do you like going on outdoor holidays?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m14_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/rhys.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes! Every Christmas, my family and I go skiing in the Alps! What about you?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes! I often go camping and hiking with my family during the Easter holidays! What is it like to go skiing?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m14_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/rhys.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"It’s a lot of fun! We fly to Italy in the evening and stay in a hotel. We go skiing every morning, except for on  the last day when we go to the local town and buy souvenirs. What do you do when you go camping?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f5_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"We always drive when we go camping because we normally stay in Wales. However, this Easter we are going to the Lake District, so I am excited to hike around the lakes and forests. We always have a barbecue on the first night, after we build our tents, and we also explore the local village on the last day!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m14_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/rhys.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"}]},{"trainer":"kidCards","onSamePage":true,"instruction":"Choose.","shuffleAtoms":true,"lsg":{"width":140},"cards":[{"id":1,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/rhys.lsg"},{"id":2,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/ana.lsg"}],"atoms":[{"solution":[1],"instruction":"Who always has a barbecue?"},{"solution":[2],"instruction":"Who travels on holiday by plane?"},{"solution":[1],"instruction":"Who is excited to hike in the forests?"},{"solution":[1],"instruction":"Who goes on their outdoor holiday in the spring?"},{"solution":[2],"instruction":"Who buys souvenirs when they explore the local town?"},{"solution":[2],"instruction":"Who is staying in a hotel?"}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Transport and Travel","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/topic","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/z065px"},"parentBlock":{"title":"On Holiday","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-02-on-holiday/block","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/v9ej15"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/f5/Hier siehst du eine mögliche Lösung","etag":"004d-10846"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3/Here is a possible solution","etag":"b4e9-9282"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/During the day, we are going to go hiking in the mountains.","etag":"ad4f-21788"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/I am going to go camping for my summer holiday.","etag":"82d9-15308"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/We are flying to Switzerland to go skiing in the Alps.","etag":"dfac-18908"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/We are going to stay in a tent in the forest.","etag":"53cb-15596"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/barbecue","etag":"f7bc-5660"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/hiking","etag":"2ff0-4940"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/skiing","etag":"adc4-5661"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/tent","etag":"e28f-3789"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f5_chirp/It’s a lot of fun! We fly to Italy in the evening and stay in a hotel. We go skiing every morning, except for on  the last day when we go to the local town and buy souvenirs. What do you do when you go camping?","etag":"9083-54591"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f5_chirp/Yes! Every Christmas, my family and I go skiing in the Alps! What about you?","etag":"ec05-22578"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f8Us/Here 